  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed two-storey side extension, by reason of its excessive bulk, scale, and poor design, including the fragmented form created by the overhanging first-floor element and retained passageway, would result in a visually discordant and incongruous addition that fails to respect the character and appearance of the host dwelling and surrounding streetscene. The development would erode the established architectural rhythm of the area, contrary to:National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (MHCLG, December 2024)Policies D4 of the London Plan (March 2021)Policies SP2, DMD1, and DMD5 of The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan (September 2024)The Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)"
